ref=\"/wiki/%E6%9C%AA%E9%94%88%E9%93%A0\" title=\"未锈铠\"><img alt=\"未锈铠\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300701.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-300701.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300701.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9C%AA%E9%94%88%E9%93%A0\" title=\"未锈铠\">未锈铠</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>3.1</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>点唱机</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>21又1</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：300731</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">技能1</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">技能2</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3007/300731/技能1.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3007/300731/技能1 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3007/300731/技能2.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3007/300731/技能2 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3007/300731/大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3007/300731/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3007/300731/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3007/300731/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">曾有亡命之徒在逃跑途中力竭倒下，在雾中遇见了一位绿衣骑士，骑士手持一柄长剑，剑格上的绿宝石闪烁着，映出了他内心的恐惧。<br /><br />亡命之徒浑身战栗，以为等待着他的将是一场审判，然而骑士并未举剑，只是静静伫立，似乎在等待什么。<br /><br />于是，他颤声开口，诉说自己堕落的一生，诉说未曾承认的懊悔。雾气将他的身影吞没，唯有声音在森林里久久回荡。<br /><br />绿骑士仔细聆听，直至故事步入尾声，直到墓碑后的幽魂们都发出一声惋惜，剑上宝石的光芒才稍稍平息。<br /><br />骑士转身，没入无边的迷雾。他不审判，只倾听；不挥剑，却让亡魂在自述中归于平静。那柄长剑，与古老的传说一道，静静等待下一个愿将自身罪恶剖析的灵魂。<br /></div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"300731\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-300707.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/9e/Belonging-300707.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">苔与藤<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Moss and Vines</div></div></div><div>无估值<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>只有绿苔与藤蔓能够坦然地与这位骑士相伴。千百年来，它们生长、攀援、飘荡，不断绽开花朵。<br />骑士赦免了道路尽头的罪人，正如绿苔与花朵赦免了长达百年的孤独。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-300708.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/7/76/Belonging-300708.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">冬青木板条护臂<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Gnarled Holly Bracers</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>坚韧藤条编结而成的臂铠，银白的金属塑造出骑士的指骨。里面空无一物，但受访者称，只有最为高尚英武的人才敢向内窥视。<br />“至于何谓高尚英武……某人记得一个古老的有关斧子的赌约，愿意一试身手吗？”</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-300709.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/65/Belonging-300709.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“公义之眼”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"The Eye of Justice\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>精钢锻铸、状若枯骨的长剑。剑格镶嵌一颗祖母绿，据称，它能看穿受审判者的心怀。<br />骑士驰骋于夏天的尽头，宣告谁即将成为亡骨，谁会在下一个春天复而新生。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%AD%82%E7%81%B5%E9%95%BF%E9%9D%921.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 魂灵长青1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%AD%82%E7%81%B5%E9%95%BF%E9%9D%921.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%AD%82%E7%81%B5%E9%95%BF%E9%9D%921.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%AD%82%E7%81%B5%E9%95%BF%E9%9D%921.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%AD%82%E7%81%B5%E9%95%BF%E9%9D%921.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%AD%82%E7%81%B5%E9%95%BF%E9%9D%921.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%AD%82%E7%81%B5%E9%95%BF%E9%9D%921.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%AD%82%E7%81%B5%E9%95%BF%E9%9D%922.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 魂灵长青2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%AD%82%E7%81%B5%E9%95%BF%E9%9D%922.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%AD%82%E7%81%B5%E9%95%BF%E9%9D%922.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%AD%82%E7%81%B5%E9%95%BF%E9%9D%922.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%AD%82%E7%81%B5%E9%95%BF%E9%9D%922.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%AD%82%E7%81%B5%E9%95%BF%E9%9D%922.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%AD%82%E7%81%B5%E9%95%BF%E9%9D%922.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">魂灵长青 <small style=\"color: grey\">The Evergreen Soul</small></span></span>"}}